{%- doc -%}
  Brutalforce: order summary above "Estimated total" (cart drawer + cart page).

    Price          €45,00 (struck)  €43,50   [Save €1,50]
    Shipping       €4,99 (struck)  FREE
    Total savings  −€6,49

  - Compare-at total = sum of each line's compare-at price (or its regular price if it has none) x qty
  - Real total       = cart.total_price (what the products cost)
  - Product savings  = compare-at total - real total  (items without compare-at add 0)
  - Shipping         = HARDCODED normal shipping (constant below), shown struck + FREE once the cart
                       reaches the free shipping amount (same test as the bar). Not read from Shopify.
                       Below that amount: "Calculated at checkout" and no shipping saving.
  - Total savings    = product savings + the hardcoded shipping (only when shipping is FREE)
  To change the normal shipping price, edit NORMAL_SHIPPING_CENTS below (499 = €4,99).
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  # --- hardcoded normal shipping price (cents) ---
  assign NORMAL_SHIPPING_CENTS = 499

  assign compare_total = 0
  for item in cart.items
    assign unit_was = item.original_price
    if item.variant.compare_at_price > unit_was
      assign unit_was = item.variant.compare_at_price
    endif
    assign compare_total = unit_was | times: item.quantity | plus: compare_total
  endfor
  assign real_total = cart.total_price
  assign product_savings = compare_total | minus: real_total
  if product_savings < 0
    assign product_savings = 0
  endif

  assign threshold_cents = settings.free_shipping_threshold | default: 30 | times: 100
  assign ships_free = false
  if threshold_cents > 0 and cart.items_subtotal_price >= threshold_cents
    assign ships_free = true
  endif

  assign total_savings = product_savings
  if ships_free
    assign total_savings = product_savings | plus: NORMAL_SHIPPING_CENTS
  endif
-%}
{%- if cart != empty -%}
  <dl class="bf-summary">
    <div class="bf-summary__row bf-summary__row--price">
      <dt>Price</dt>
      <dd>
        {%- if product_savings > 0 -%}
          <s class="bf-summary__was">{{ compare_total | money }}</s>
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="bf-summary__now">{{ real_total | money }}</span>
        {%- if product_savings > 0 -%}
          <span class="bf-summary__badge">Save {{ product_savings | money }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="bf-summary__row bf-summary__row--shipping">
      <dt>Shipping</dt>
      <dd>
        {%- if ships_free -%}
          <s class="bf-summary__was">{{ NORMAL_SHIPPING_CENTS | money }}</s>
          <strong class="bf-summary__free">FREE</strong>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="bf-summary__muted">Calculated at checkout</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </dd>
    </div>
    {%- if total_savings > 0 -%}
      <div class="bf-summary__row bf-summary__row--save">
        <dt>Total savings</dt>
        <dd>−{{ total_savings | money }}</dd>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </dl>
{%- endif -%}
